# Markdown Processing Rules

## Landing.ai Output
- Contains HTML comments with metadata: `<!-- text, from page X -->`
- Has ID markers: `{#id-string}`
- May include HTML tables that need conversion
- Always clean before displaying

## Cleaning Process
1. Remove all HTML comments
2. Strip ID markers and data-id attributes
3. Convert HTML tables to markdown
4. Normalize table formatting
5. Clean excessive whitespace

## Table Formatting
- ALWAYS display extracted data as clean 2-column tables
- Format: Field Name | Value
- Use markdown table syntax with proper alignment
- Handle empty values gracefully

## Frontend Display
- Always use `prepareMarkdownForDisplay()` before rendering
- Use ReactMarkdown with remarkGfm plugin
- Apply consistent table styling with Tailwind

## Key Functions
- Backend: Clean markdown before storing
- Frontend: [enhancedMarkdownUtils.ts](mdc:frontend/src/utils/enhancedMarkdownUtils.ts)
- Always validate table structure

## Display Rules
- Never show raw JSON to users
- Always format as readable tables
- Preserve original formatting for non-table content
- Handle nested structures by flattening